    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>fleet-dwell-metrics-steps · 4×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1024 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-fleet-dwell-recipe-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-fleet-dwell-recipe-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const timestampsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; timestamps: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const trackOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; trackOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const runStartFlagsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; runStartFlags: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const runEndFlagsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; runEndFlags: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const TRACK_COUNT: u32 = 12u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const NO_TRACK: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">fn findTrack(row: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  var low = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  var high = TRACK_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  loop {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">    if (low &gt;= high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">      break;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">    let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">    if (trackOffsets[trackOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= row) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">      low = middle + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">      high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  if (low == 0u || row &gt;= trackOffsets[trackOffsetsOffset + TRACK_COUNT]) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">    return NO_TRACK;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  return low - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">fn timeDifferenceRows(a: u32, b: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  return timestamps[timestampsOffset + a] - timestamps[timestampsOffset + b];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">fn isTimeNonDecreasing(a: u32, b: u32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  return timestamps[timestampsOffset + a] &gt;= timestamps[timestampsOffset + b];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">fn getStepDistance(row: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let deltaX = positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row] - positions[positionsOffset + 2u * (row - 1u)];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  let deltaY = positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u] - positions[positionsOffset + 2u * (row - 1u) + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  return sqrt(deltaX * deltaX + deltaY * deltaY);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">fn getStepDuration(row: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  return timeDifferenceRows(row, row - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">fn isSlowStep(row: u32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  let stepDuration = getStepDuration(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  let stepDistance = getStepDistance(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  return isTimeNonDecreasing(row, row - 1u) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">    (stepDistance == 0.0 || stepDistance &lt; parameters[parametersOffset] * stepDuration);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"68\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"69\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  _ = &amp;timestamps;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  _ = &amp;trackOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  _ = &amp;runStartFlags;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  _ = &amp;runEndFlags;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  var stepDistance = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  var stepSpeed = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  var runStart = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  var runEnd = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  let track = findTrack(index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  if (track != NO_TRACK) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    let trackStart = trackOffsets[trackOffsetsOffset + track];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    let trackEnd = trackOffsets[trackOffsetsOffset + track + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">    if (index &gt; trackStart) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">      stepDistance = getStepDistance(index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">      let stepDuration = getStepDuration(index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">      if (stepDuration &gt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">        stepSpeed = stepDistance / stepDuration;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">      if (isSlowStep(index)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">        let previousSlow = index - 1u &gt; trackStart &amp;&amp; isSlowStep(index - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">        let nextSlow = index + 1u &lt; trackEnd &amp;&amp; isSlowStep(index + 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">        runStart = select(1u, 0u, previousSlow);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">        runEnd = select(1u, 0u, nextSlow);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  runStartFlags[runStartFlagsOffset + index] = runStart;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  runEndFlags[runEndFlagsOffset + index] = runEnd;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>timestamps<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"timestamps\">timestamps</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>trackOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"trackOffsets\">trackOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"metrics-parameters\">metrics-parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>runStartFlags<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"fleet-dwell-metrics-run-start-flags\">fleet-dwell-metrics-run-start-flags</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>runEndFlags<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"fleet-dwell-metrics-run-end-flags\">fleet-dwell-metrics-run-end-flags</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUTrajectoryMetrics/steps · main · 505fd2b6</figcaption></figure></section>",
